This directory is part of a larger Apache-2.0 repository and carries the same
licence as its parent, deliberately: a second, different licence in a
subdirectory would re-open a question the parent repository's LICENSE and NOTICE
were committed to close. The full licence text is in the LICENSE file at the root
of this repository.

No third-party code is vendored here, and this tool has no runtime dependencies.

It does read two upstream documents as its authority for key names, without
copying them: the Neuro SAN Agent Network HOCON File Reference and the Neuro SAN
agent-network JSON Schema, both from Cognizant AI Lab and both Apache-2.0. Where
this tool quotes either one, the quote is marked as such in the source.

  - neuro-san   https://github.com/cognizant-ai-lab/neuro-san
  - nsdeploy    https://github.com/cognizant-ai-lab/nsdeploy

The specification this tool checks against is the Minimum Viable Specification
for a Worldwide Agentic Web, MVP Profile 0.3, 18 November 2026, Cognizant AI Lab.
Section references in the output ("§3.2", "§2.1") are to that document.
